category: Net
build-depends: cygport gettext-devel libdbi-devel libglib2.0-devel libiconv-devel libintl-devel libiodbc-devel libmariadb-devel libpq-devel
sdesc: "Command line utility which allows to use all libGammu features (utilities)"
ldesc: "Gammu is command line utility and library to work with mobile phones
from many vendors. Support for different models differs, but basic
functions should work with majority of them. Program can work with
contacts, messages (SMS, EMS and MMS), calendar, todos, filesystem,
integrated radio, camera, etc. It also supports daemon mode to send and
receive SMSes."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/gammu/gammu/
